      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Insufficiency bone fracture of the medial tibial plateau occurs in elderly patient. Pain and disability are important. Physical examination and initial X-Ray are note contributive. Insufficiency fracture appeared on bone scan as localised hyperfixation and as a slow intensity image of the medial tibial plateau on MR Imaging. Outcome is favorable with discharge."},
